# The deployment images use the repository root as build context (the lockfile lives here), so this file is what keeps
# secrets, local state and build output from being sent to the Docker daemon at all.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/uploads
**/coverage

# Real environment files and secrets (only *.example templates are meant to be in the context)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
deploy/secrets
deploy/compose.env
deploy/env.production

# Not needed to build
screenshot.png
AUDIT.md
docs
**/tests
